Feature: data-view (RETROACTIVE — commit 65fdc2f, logged after the changelog/
convention was introduced in 478c817)
Target module: DataView (new)

Added vUX-dataView.js: keyed data-to-DOM binding for hot-update views — updateRow
writes only changed cells, sort/setData move existing nodes (preserving focus/input
state), filter toggles visibility; data-v-row / data-v-field template contract.
Also registered dataView.js in the module registry (deduping the doubled
spaEngine.js entry and adding the missing formValidator/progressIndicator/toolTip/
domDrawer entries), added doc/data-view.md, and documented the SPA engine's new
exitCallback in its guide.

Affected projects: consumers gain a new module; window.vUxModules now lists the
full, correct module set.
